{"seconds": 79.9, "exit": 0, "final": "The main line is clear: **1...h4** locks White's pawns and creates a winning endgame. Black's h-pawn will promote while the g-pawn is tied down.\n\n---\n\n**Best move:** h4\n\n**Main line:** 1...h4 2.Kf5 Kg1 3.Kxg5 Kh2 4.Kf4 g5 5.Kg4 Kg2\n\n**Motif:** Zugzwang / Pawn Endgame Technique\n\n**Coaching Note (80 words):**\nWhen your opponent's pawns are separated, lock them together if possible. After h4, White's g4 and h3 pawns are frozen and can't defend each other. White's king must deal with both Black pawns but can't stop the h-pawn from advancing while also capturing the g5 pawn. This zugzwang wins the resulting pawn endgame. Look for moves that immobilize your opponent's pieces while keeping your own options open.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"h4\", \"line\": [\"h4\", \"Kf5\", \"Kg1\", \"Kxg5\", \"Kh2\", \"Kf4\"], \"motifs\": [\"zugzwang\", \"quietMove\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1pp/6P1/7P/5k2/8 b - - 0 52"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1pp/6P1/7P/5k2/8 b - - 0 52"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1pp/6P1/7P/5k2/8 b - - 0 52"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1pp/6P1/7P/5k2/8 b - - 0 52", "move": "hxg4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1p1/6p1/7P/5k2/8 w - - 0 53", "move": "hxg4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1pp/6P1/7P/5k2/8 b - - 0 52", "move": "h4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1p1/6Pp/7P/5k2/8 w - - 0 53", "move": "gxh4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1p1/6Pp/7P/5k2/8 w - - 0 53"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/4K1p1/6Pp/7P/5k2/8 w - - 0 53", "move": "Kf5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/8/8/5Kp1/6Pp/7P/5k2/8 b - - 1 53", "move": "Kg3"}}, {"tool": "che